    <briefdescription>
<para>This CFG Deadness finds dead blocks and edges. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Algorithm starts with a set of blocks unreachable from entry then propagates deadness using foldable conditional branches without modifying CFG. So GVN does but it changes CFG by splitting critical edges. In most cases passes rely on SimplifyCFG to clean up dead blocks, but in some cases, like verification or loop passes it&apos;s not possible. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
